## 🏗️ Architecture

```
User → Guardrails → Semantic Cache → LangGraph Router
                                          ├── Vector RAG (Hybrid + Rerank)
                                          └── Web Search (Tavily)
                                              ↓
                                       Synthesizer → Verifier (loop if hallucinated)
                                              ↓
                                       Citation Linker → Streamlit UI
```

### The 6 Agent Nodes
| Agent | Role |
|---|---|
| 🧭 **Query Analyzer** | Classifies intent, detects ambiguity |
| 🔀 **Router** | Routes query to RAG, Web, or Direct |
| 🔍 **RAG Agent** | Hybrid retrieval + reranking |
| 🌐 **Web Agent** | Tavily search for recent info |
| ✍️ **Synthesizer** | Generates draft answer |
| 🕵️ **Verifier** | Hallucination detection + retry trigger |

